 (1.1MB, pptx) Supplementary file1 Fig. 1 MRI findings in Case 1. (A) T2-weighted image, (B) contrasted-enhanced T1-weighted image, (C) diffusion weighted image and (D) apparent diffusion coefficient map. Arrow: the uterine tumor (PPTX 1097 KB) 13691_2024_721_MOESM2_ESM.pptx (12.5MB, pptx) Supplementary file2 Fig. 2 The pathological findings of Case 1. (A) The uterine tumor, (B) lymphatic invasion of the uterine tumor and (C and D) lymph node metastasis; (A) macroscopic image, (B and C) Hematoxylin-Eosin (HE) staining and (D) SMARCA4 nuclear staining. Scale bars: (B–D) 100μm (PPTX 12769 KB) 13691_2024_721_MOESM3_ESM.pptx (1.2MB, pptx) Supplementary file3 Fig. 3 MRI findings in Case 2. (A) T2-weighted image and (B) diffusion weighted image. Arrow: the uterine tumor. (C) macroscopic image (PPTX 1277 KB) Data Availability Statement The datasets used during the current study are available from the corresponding author on reasonable request.',25,'2025-10-13 07:00:01','2025-10-13 07:00:01');
